// vr_tunables_rows.inc -- the Tunables page's rows (Debug > Tunables; vr_tunables.cpp), one per tuning constant in
// vr_tunables.inc (the same order; the build checks there is one for each): the start of a single settings schema
// (design review 9). Each row is the menu row the constant had before it became one (its label, range, step, format,
// how far past the bar left and right go, help); the ones that never had a row get a range from their default.
//   QVR_TUNABLE_GROUP("Page > Subpage")  the rows below came from that page: their submenu on the Tunables page
//                                        (Tunables > Page > Subpage; " - " splits too: "Combat > Armed Grunts - AI
//                                        Behaviour"; vr_menu_tunables.inc). No page of their own: "<System> > Other"
//   QVR_TUNABLE_SLIDER(name, label, min, max, step, format, hardMin, hardMax, help)
//   QVR_TUNABLE_CYCLE(name, label, help, {value, "label"}...)
//   QVR_TUNABLE_TEXT(name, label, help)  a text or a vector: set with tune in the console

